# request.json here, the path unit starts ``request``, which deletes it at once (a share's password may be
# in it) and answers in STATE/request-result.json, with no secret.
REQUESTS = Path(ENV("SUVERYN_BACKUP_REQUESTS", "/run/suveryn/backup-requests"))
